'''High Executor Darthalia''' is a [[Forsaken]] [[quest giver]] located in [[Tarren Mill]] in the [[Hillsbrad Foothills]]. She commands the [[Forsaken]] forces from her command post, and is under the direct command of the dreadlord [[Varimathras]] and [[Sylvanas Windrunner]]. Her job is stop the spread of [[Human]]s and other Alliance members in Hillsbrad.

